\newlabel{tab:comparison_robertson}{{11}{33}{Robertson comparison ($t_f = 10^4$): FP-FSP ($\varepsilon _{\Delta t}{=}0.01$, $\alpha {=}0.4$, $\varepsilon _{\mathrm {flux}}{=}10^{-9}$) vs.\ Krylov-FSP-SSA with the correct absorbing-form generator (Algorithm~2 of~\cite {VoSidje2016}, $\varepsilon {=}10^{-2}$, $\tau _{\mathrm {init}}{=}0.1$, $r{=}1$, max\_iter${=}500$). Only FP-FSP completes $t_f$.\relax }{table.caption.203}{}}
